## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- Go {{.GoVersion}} or higher
- {{if eq .DatabaseDriver "postgres"}}PostgreSQL 12+{{else if eq .DatabaseDriver "mysql"}}MySQL 8.0+{{else if eq .DatabaseDriver "sqlite"}}SQLite3{{else}}No database requirements{{end}}
- Docker (optional)

### Installation

1. Clone the repository:
```bash
git clone <your-repo-url>
cd {{.ProjectName}}
```

2. Install dependencies:
```bash
make deps
```

3. Set up your environment:
```bash
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env with your configuration
```

{{- if ne .DatabaseDriver ""}}
4. Set up the database:
{{- if eq .DatabaseDriver "postgres"}}
```bash
# Create database
createdb {{.ProjectName}}_dev

# Run migrations
make migrate-up
```
{{- else if eq .DatabaseDriver "mysql"}}
```bash
# Create database
mysql -u root -p -e "CREATE DATABASE {{.ProjectName}}_dev;"

# Run migrations
make migrate-up
```
{{- else if eq .DatabaseDriver "sqlite"}}
```bash
# SQLite database will be created automatically
# Run migrations
make migrate-up
```
{{- end}}
{{- end}}

5. Run the application:
```bash
make run
```

The API will be available at `http://localhost:8080`

### Development

For development with hot reload:
```bash
make dev
```

### Running Tests

```bash
# Run all tests
make test

# Run tests with coverage
make test-coverage

# Run integration tests
make test-integration
```

## API Endpoints

### Health Checks
- `GET /health` - Health check endpoint
- `GET /ready` - Readiness check endpoint

{{- if ne .DatabaseDriver ""}}
### Users
- `GET /api/v1/users` - List users with pagination
- `GET /api/v1/users/{id}` - Get user by ID
- `POST /api/v1/users` - Create new user
- `PUT /api/v1/users/{id}` - Update user
- `DELETE /api/v1/users/{id}` - Delete user
{{- end}}

{{- if and (ne .AuthType "") (ne .AuthType "none")}}
### Authentication
- `POST /api/v1/auth/login` - User login
- `POST /api/v1/auth/register` - User registration
- `POST /api/v1/auth/refresh` - Refresh access token
- `POST /api/v1/auth/logout` - User logout (requires authentication)
- `GET /api/v1/auth/me` - Get current user (requires authentication)
{{- end}}

### Documentation
- `GET /docs` - API documentation (OpenAPI/Swagger)

{{- if .EnableMetrics}}
### Metrics
- `GET /metrics` - Prometheus metrics endpoint
{{- end}}

## Configuration

The application supports configuration through:

1. **Configuration files** (`configs/config.{env}.yaml`)
2. **Environment variables**
3. **Command line flags**

### Environment Variables

| Variable | Description | Default |
|----------|-------------|---------|
| `PORT` | Server port | `8080` |
| `LOG_LEVEL` | Logging level | `info` |
{{- if ne .DatabaseDriver ""}}
| `DATABASE_URL` | Database connection URL | - |
| `DB_HOST` | Database host | `localhost` |
| `DB_PORT` | Database port | {{if eq .DatabaseDriver "postgres"}}`5432`{{else if eq .DatabaseDriver "mysql"}}`3306`{{else}}-{{end}} |
| `DB_USER` | Database username | `{{.ProjectName}}` |
| `DB_PASSWORD` | Database password | `password` |
| `DB_NAME` | Database name | `{{.ProjectName}}` |
{{- end}}
{{- if and (ne .AuthType "") (ne .AuthType "none")}}
| `JWT_SECRET` | JWT signing secret | - |
{{- end}}

